      "id": "5027758e81e74040529e9df34bd5e8230dbd4c6e",
      "message": "Add analytics dashboard web UI with Chart.js\n\nAnalytics Dashboard Features:\n- Full-featured analytics page at /analytics.html\n- Provider selector dropdown\n- Period selector (7d, 30d, 90d)\n- Real-time data refresh\n- Navigation back to main dashboard\n\nStats Overview Panel:\n- 4 stat cards with current values\n- Success rate, avg duration, builds/day, failure rate\n- Trend indicators (↑↓→) with color coding\n- Percentage change from previous period\n\nCharts (Chart.js):\n- Success Rate Trend (bar chart)\n- Average Duration (bar chart)\n- Build Frequency (bar chart)\n- Failure Rate (bar chart)\n- Period-over-period comparison\n- Current vs Previous period visualization\n\nUI/UX:\n- Dark theme matching main dashboard\n- Responsive grid layout\n- Loading states and error handling\n- Empty state for no data\n- Clean, terminal-style design\n\nTechnical:\n- Fetches from /api/analytics/trends endpoint\n- Async data loading with error handling\n- Chart.js 4.4.0 from CDN\n- Proper chart cleanup on refresh\n- 5-second request timeout\n\nAll tests passing (165+)",
